## Step 3 — Write the Markdown File

### Output location

Write the file to:
```
agents/requirements/output/<jira-id>-<slug>.md
```
where:
- `<jira-id>` is lowercase with a hyphen (e.g. `ngondl-931`)
- `<slug>` is a 2–4 word kebab-case description derived from the story title
  (e.g. `consent-retrieval`, `confluence-doc-update`)

If the Jira ID is TBD, use `tbd-<slug>` as the filename prefix.

Full workspace path:
```
/Users/earguijo/Documents/Salesforce/Projects/Insulet/GitHub/na-patient/agents/requirements/output/
```

