Trigger phrase: **"generate user story"** followed by the five input fields, or supply
the fields directly in this format:

```
Context: <text or Jira ID>
Source Material: <links or N/A>
Endpoints: <METHOD /path - description, or N/A>
Mandatory Acceptance Criteria: <free-text list>
References:
  Miro Board: <URL or N/A>
  Confluence: <URL or N/A>
```
